1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,140
What if the internet disappeared for five seconds?

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,460
You're in Times Square.

3
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:05,390
It's Friday night.

4
00:00:05,410 --> 00:00:07,850
All around you, invisible data is flying.

5
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:09,430
Every phone. Every screen.

6
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:10,580
Every card tap.

7
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:13,760
Three. Two. One.

8
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:17,480
Nearly eight hundred thousand Google searches never happen.

9
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,400
About twenty million emails freeze in mid-air.

10
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,900
Tens of thousands of card payments just hang.

11
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:26,200
And every phone in this square says the same thing: no connection.

12
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:28,720
Then, it all comes back.

13
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:31,380
Five seconds. So what would you miss first?

14
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:32,200
Comment below.
